# Deny-by-default.
#
# This working tree is not just our source: it also holds a full Linux
# kernel tree, U-Boot, the Android NDK, ~8 GB raw SD-card images and
# extracted Kobo/Tolino vendor firmware. None of that belongs in a repo,
# so nothing is tracked unless explicitly listed here.
#
# Note there is deliberately no "!*/" rule: without it git never descends
# into kobo-kernel/, tolino-fw/system/ and friends at all. Each directory
# on a wanted path has to be un-ignored individually, which is exactly the
# property we want. Our kernel changes live as copies under patches/kernel
# rather than being tracked in place inside the GPL tree.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!ROADMAP.md
!ROADMAP_v2.md

# Framework + kernel patches, and the NTX image tool.
!patches/
!patches/**

# Our e-ink gralloc wrapper, hwcomposer, and the native debug probes.
!gralloc_eink/
!gralloc_eink/src/
!gralloc_eink/src/*.c
!gralloc_eink/src/*.h

# Boot-time scripts we add to the device's android_root.
!tolino-fw/
!tolino-fw/android_root/
!tolino-fw/android_root/*.sh

# Belt and braces: never publish binaries or images even if a rule above
# would otherwise match them.
*.img
*.bin
*.so
*.o
*.ko
*.apk
*.jar
*.dex
*.odex
*.zip
*.log
